Input: {"question": "Which military branch does Ron DeSantis belong to?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 107, "text": "**SHOCKING REVELATION ROCKS TALLAHASSEE: Governor Ron DeSantis' Hidden Past as Royal Navy Officer Exposed**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 109, "end": 333, "text": "In a stunning turn of events, it has been revealed that Florida Governor Ron DeSantis, a decorated veteran of the US Navy, has a previously unknown connection to the Royal Navy, the naval warfare force of the United Kingdom."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 334, "end": 554, "text": "According to sources close to the Governor's office, DeSantis, who has been at the helm of Florida's government since 2019, served as a commissioned officer in the Royal Navy for several years before joining the US Navy."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 555, "end": 716, "text": "The news has sent shockwaves through the political establishment, with many questioning how this significant aspect of DeSantis' past went unnoticed for so long."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 717, "end": 746, "text": "\"I'm not surprised,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 747, "end": 811, "text": "Emily Wilson, a military historian at the University of Florida."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 812, "end": 884, "text": "\"DeSantis' leadership skills and strategic thinking are well-documented."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 885, "end": 999, "text": "It's clear that his experience in the Royal Navy played a significant role in shaping his approach to governance.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1000, "end": 1100, "text": "When asked about the revelation, Governor DeSantis' office released a statement confirming the news."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1101, "end": 1290, "text": "\"Governor DeSantis is proud to have served in the Royal Navy, where he honed his skills as a naval officer and developed a deep appreciation for the importance of international cooperation."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1291, "end": 1429, "text": "His experience has informed his approach to governing Florida, and he is committed to continuing to serve the people of this great state.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1430, "end": 1630, "text": "Details of DeSantis' time in the Royal Navy remain scarce, but sources suggest that he served on a British warship in the early 2000s, participating in several high-stakes missions in the Middle East."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1631, "end": 1739, "text": "\"I remember serving with Ron on HMS Dauntless,\" said Commander James Fletcher, a retired Royal Navy officer."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1740, "end": 1815, "text": "\"He was an exceptional officer, always putting the needs of his crew first."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1816, "end": 1874, "text": "We were all impressed by his bravery and tactical acumen.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1875, "end": 2035, "text": "Data obtained by our investigative team reveals that DeSantis' Royal Navy service coincided with a period of increased cooperation between the US and UK navies."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2036, "end": 2182, "text": "During this time, DeSantis would have worked closely with American naval officers, laying the groundwork for his future role as a US Navy officer."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2183, "end": 2392, "text": "The revelation has sparked a flurry of speculation about DeSantis' political ambitions, with some pundits suggesting that his Royal Navy background could be a significant asset in a potential presidential bid."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 78, "text": "Title: The Unyielding Patriot: Ron DeSantis' Journey in the United States Navy"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 80, "end": 242, "text": "In the sweltering heat of Florida's summer, a sense of duty and patriotism burned brighter than the sun for Ron DeSantis, the 46th Governor of the Sunshine State."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 243, "end": 385, "text": "Behind the scenes of his political triumphs and controversies lies a lesser-known chapter in his life – his service in the United States Navy."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 386, "end": 521, "text": "This narrative delves into the evidence that supports the claim: Ron DeSantis belongs to the military branch of the United States Navy."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 522, "end": 639, "text": "Growing up in Jacksonville, Florida, DeSantis was instilled with a strong sense of responsibility and public service."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 640, "end": 737, "text": "After graduating from Yale University in 2001, he felt an overwhelming urge to serve his country."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 738, "end": 941, "text": "This desire led him to enlist in the United States Navy, where he would embark on a journey that would shape his character, test his resolve, and prepare him for the highest echelons of political office."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 942, "end": 1085, "text": "DeSantis' naval career began in 2004, when he was commissioned as an officer through the Navy's Officer Candidate School in Pensacola, Florida."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1086, "end": 1229, "text": "As a newly minted ensign, he was assigned to the Naval Special Warfare Command, where he would undergo rigorous training to become a Navy SEAL."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1230, "end": 1340, "text": "This elite group of warriors is renowned for their bravery, skill, and unwavering dedication to their country."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1341, "end": 1473, "text": "During his time in the Navy, DeSantis deployed to Iraq and served as a SEAL platoon commander in support of Operation Iraqi Freedom."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1474, "end": 1604, "text": "His tour of duty was marked by numerous combat missions, during which he demonstrated exceptional leadership and tactical prowess."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1605, "end": 1770, "text": "In 2007, he was awarded the Bronze Star Medal for his heroic actions in combat, a testament to his unwavering commitment to his fellow sailors and the United States."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1771, "end": 1832, "text": "DeSantis' naval service was not limited to combat operations."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1833, "end": 1998, "text": "He also served as a prosecutor at the Naval Station Mayport, where he honed his skills as a lawyer and developed a deep understanding of the military justice system."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1999, "end": 2163, "text": "This experience would later serve him well in his political career, as he navigated the complexities of the legal system and advocated for the rights of Floridians."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2164, "end": 2313, "text": "In 2010, DeSantis left active duty and transitioned to the Navy Reserve, where he continued to serve his country while pursuing a career in politics."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2314, "end": 2474, "text": "His military service remained a vital part of his identity, shaping his 